    <Description>Since CombatArms:Reloaded And Classic Dont allow u to Keep Jumping When u Hold Space I Made This Simple Macro That Allow u to Keep Jumping When u Hold Space Please Read The Next Things that i type its Very Important, When u Finish And Add The AutoJump Macro Bind it to Space and than After u bind It Right Click Space Than Go To Operating Mode Click On it Than Click Run While You Hold the Key Recommended Key - Space

